// Character costume looks (docs/DESIGN.md "Character costumes"; schema: crates/bd_shapes/src/costume/look.rs).
// Private-use fan tribute: character names/looks belong to their owners — replace before any public release.
// Colours: "rrggbb" hex (or a few names). Variants are patches over `look` (fields they set replace the base).
// Typing a name picks the character; extra words matching a variant's name/words pick that variant;
// VARIANT in the costume editor cycles them. Never listed in UI (MYSTERY tenet).
